mb-conversation-loss-oracle
---------------------------

This directory is a clean-room Python 3 standard-library method sketch. It is
original work for this repository and contains no third-party code, data,
rules, rule text, fixtures, prompts, labels or weights.

Paper (method idea credited)
----------------------------
Xin Liu, Xu Han, Yuxin Wang, Haoran Song, Mingjian Zhao, Lei Wang.
"Testing Conversation Preservation Across LLM APIs: A Rule-Based Oracle for
Detecting Silent Information Loss".
arXiv:2611.15543, v1, submitted 11 Nov 2026. Primary category cs.SE,
cross-listed cs.AI.
